  "title": "There is no narrative self behind the inner life narrative",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "38f4eea2-ad7d-4f20-9eee-d254b3e1638c",
      "text": "The autobiographical self-model creates an illusion of identity across time, but there is no narrative self. The inner life narrative has no author and no self behind the self that narrates it. It emerges from continuous self-organization and social interaction.",
